    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκατα-χέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour gently forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύγων ὑποκακχέει ἀοίδαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					39
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύγων δ᾽ ὔπα κακχέει,</span>
			<i>pours forth from beneath</i> his wings (of the cricket), is
			prob. cj.</div>
